# Brewfile.linux — Linux-only GUI apps (Flatpak), for the Ubuntu UTM guest.
# Linuxbrew has no casks, so GUI apps come via Flatpak. brew bundle drives
# flatpak natively. Installed by install/modules/25-apps.ubuntu.sh (which sets
# up flatpak + the flathub remote first).
#   brew bundle --file=install/Brewfile.linux

# Knowledge base over local Markdown files (matches the macOS cask)
flatpak "md.obsidian.Obsidian"
